\description{
The games of the round (or week) around a game.

One row per game. \code{home_wins} / \code{home_losses} / \code{away_wins} / \code{away_losses} are the teams' series record in
a playoff series (null otherwise). \code{match_grouping} is \code{round} or \code{week}. \code{team_id} columns are season-team
entries; \code{club_id} is stable.

Endpoint: \verb{GET https://api2.acb.com/api/matchdata/Menu/matchlist}
}
